      "html" : "<\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-171272\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-171272\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>An automatic sprinkler system shall be installed throughout buildings containing Group H-5 occupancies. The design of the sprinkler system shall not be less than that required by this code for the occupancy hazard classifications in accordance with <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-171271', hash: '#JD_BCTable903.2.5.2' }}\">Table 903.2.5.2<\/Link>. Where the design area of the sprinkler system consists of a corridor protected by one row of sprinklers, the maximum number of sprinklers required to be calculated is 13.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-171273\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-171273\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><a name=\"JD_BCTable903.2.5.2\" id=\"JD_BCTable903.2.5.2\" title=\"BC Table 903.2.5.2\"><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Table 903.2.5.2<br><\/br>Group H-5 Sprinkler Design Criteria<\/span><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-171274\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-171274\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div style=\"margin-bottom=10pt\">&#160;<div class=\"xsl-table\">",
      "id" : "1591-html-1",
